{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29187","headline":"送客自两河归江南 · 许浑","name":"送客自两河归江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两河庶事已堪伤，南客秋归路更长。\n台畔古松悲魏帝，苑边修竹吊梁王。\n山行露变茱萸色，水宿风披菡萏香。\n遥羡落帆逢旧友，绿蛾青鬓醉横塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}